cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  When using the methodology or scientific results, cite the companion
  ESWA manuscript identified in CITATION.bib. The paper is under revision
  and has no verified published DOI. For reuse of this repository, cite
  this software; empirical datasets retain their own attribution requirements.
type: software
title: "Scan-Level Reliability and Gross-Error Diagnosis in Wi-Fi Fingerprinting"
authors:
  - given-names: Ahmed
    family-names: Mansour
repository-code: "https://github.com/AhmedMansoour/wifi-fingerprinting-scan-level-reliability"
url: "https://ahmedmansoour.github.io/wifi-fingerprinting-scan-level-reliability/"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python, Android, and interactive research-software assets
  for scan-level diagnostics of Wi-Fi fingerprinting reliability and
  gross-error discrimination.
keywords:
  - Wi-Fi fingerprinting
  - indoor positioning
  - reliability diagnostics
  - gross-error diagnosis
  - reproducible research
